Data Attribution:

This project uses data from:

1. NASA TESS Mission (Transiting Exoplanet Survey Satellite)
   - Ricker et al., 2015, Journal of Astronomical Telescopes, Instruments, and Systems
   - https://tess.mit.edu/

2. MAST (Mikulski Archive for Space Telescopes)
   - https://mast.stsci.edu/

3. ExoFOP-TESS (Exoplanet Follow-up Observing Program)
   - https://exofop.ipac.caltech.edu/tess/

4. Lightkurve Python Package
   - Lightkurve Collaboration et al., 2018
   - https://docs.lightkurve.org/

If you use the transit timing data from this project, please also cite
the original TESS mission and the relevant data sources.
